<title>USA: JSB Financial Inc Q1 net and share rise.</title>
<headline>JSB Financial Inc Q1 net and share rise.</headline>
<dateline>LYNBROOK, N.Y. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.63		    $0.56</p>
<p> Net			  6,448		    6,078</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,266		   10,877</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net interest income for the 97 quarter was $16.9 million vs $16.8 million in the 96 quarter.</p>
<p>JSB Financial Inc is the holding company for Jamaica Savings Bank FSB.</p>
